  "description": "\"We were clearly each other's first love..!\" Ten years ago, Jahee, the first love that Janyeong cowardly ended, returns as someone else's first love. What's more, she's the first love of the very person who made them break up..!! Janyeong, who doesn't want to be hurt anymore, wants to run away from Jahee, but a somehow changed Jahee begins to relentlessly pursue Janyeong... This love, returning after 10 years... Will it truly be fulfilled?\n\n**Original Webtoon:**    \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=857655), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=15035844)",
